{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=6 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>pinball</strong> like never before with <strong>Appulse</strong>. Dive into this intense <strong>roguelite shooter,</strong> where your mission is to defend the fleet of the Galactic Federation. Improve your equipment, buy new weapons and unlock powerful perks in order to defeat the waves of the Iron Accord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/189406c623c72bbc5e39b5f6ef7acb24.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/189406c623c72bbc5e39b5f6ef7acb24.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/189406c623c72bbc5e39b5f6ef7acb24.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/6bdf9efc2304fb57602a53501192677e.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/6bdf9efc2304fb57602a53501192677e.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=6 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classic <strong>Space Cadet Pinball</strong>, Appulse is a futuristic reinterpretation of the genre. Bringing newcomers and old timers by mixing the <strong>juicy mechanics of the pinball</strong> and the <strong>thrilling and fast gameplay of a roguelite shooter,</strong> we want to spark a new interest among the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful to the pinball legacy, we designed completely <strong>unique tables</strong> and secondary levels. We went beyond by creating a whole <strong>sci-fi universe</strong> for Appulse. Each level is a spaceship and your ennemis are tripods armed with lasers, to better immerse yourself in this space war. Your goal is to <strong>protect the mother ship</strong>, cruising through space in the hope of unveiling the truth of the Elysium Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2ce58b71cc9b17522bbd57dd902a5b81.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2ce58b71cc9b17522bbd57dd902a5b81.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2ce58b71cc9b17522bbd57dd902a5b81.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/f181318f2dd54e5cb59fb771c4d4c420.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/f181318f2dd54e5cb59fb771c4d4c420.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=6 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack is the best form of defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge on enemy spaceships using your <strong>ejection cannon</strong>. Challenges and special quests await you in those unknown territories. <strong>Conquer new shuttles</strong> to add them to <strong>your fleet</strong> and win the war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/bbed88359231bfe564c4b9bb19339736.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/bbed88359231bfe564c4b9bb19339736.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/bbed88359231bfe564c4b9bb19339736.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/6dca5c4965ceeed41a15fd930e7e1a25.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/6dca5c4965ceeed41a15fd930e7e1a25.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=6 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But do not worry, to face the trouble you brought <strong>your own arsenal</strong> to the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick the weapon</strong> of your choice to destroy the robots trying to stop you. In Appulse, the twist is the added <strong>recoil when firing your guns</strong>. Each shot will push you in the opposite direction, allowing you to <strong>control the ball</strong> after using the flippers. Master this technique and you will be able to go anywhere you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2bdf6733ed694883aa432d534bfdfdda.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2bdf6733ed694883aa432d534bfdfdda.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2bdf6733ed694883aa432d534bfdfdda.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns are not your only edge. <strong>Special perks</strong> earned during your adventure will power up your ball. Need <strong>more recoil</strong> when firing? <strong>Turrets</strong> to assist you in the ship's defense? Or maybe the ability to <strong>slow down time</strong> to make the perfect move? You have the cards in your hands to create the perfect <strong>build</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be aware, they are all <strong>randomized.</strong>\u00a0You are guaranteed to get a unique run each time you put a coin in the machine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1fee70fa56b5e913e9e041bded7961fc.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1fee70fa56b5e913e9e041bded7961fc.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1fee70fa56b5e913e9e041bded7961fc.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your flipper with precision, craft your own build, defeat your foes and master the scoreboard!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/fb78e1a24dc2c28e5a76dc11a001a6bc.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/fb78e1a24dc2c28e5a76dc11a001a6bc.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/fb78e1a24dc2c28e5a76dc11a001a6bc.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498700?t=1767862997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498700?t=1767862997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/ce22ad8b070e082089c16469cde51dfa7f15201a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767862997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/ce22ad8b070e082089c16469cde51dfa7f15201a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767862997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http