eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/f181318f2dd54e5cb59fb771c4d4c420.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=6 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack is the best form of defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge on enemy spaceships using your <strong>ejection cannon</strong>. Challenges and special quests await you in those unknown territories. <strong>Conquer new shuttles</strong> to add them to <strong>your fleet</strong> and win the war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/bbed88359231bfe564c4b9bb19339736.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/bbed88359231bfe564c4b9bb19339736.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/bbed88359231bfe564c4b9bb19339736.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/6dca5c4965ceeed41a15fd930e7e1a25.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/6dca5c4965ceeed41a15fd930e7e1a25.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras_big/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1767862997 width=800 height=6 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But do not worry, to face the trouble you brought <strong>your own arsenal</strong> to the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick the weapon</strong> of your choice to destroy the robots trying to stop you. In Appulse, the twist is the added <strong>recoil when firing your guns</strong>. Each shot will push you in the opposite direction, allowing you to <strong>control the ball</strong> after using the flippers. Master this technique and you will be able to go anywhere you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2bdf6733ed694883aa432d534bfdfdda.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2bdf6733ed694883aa432d534bfdfdda.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2bdf6733ed694883aa432d534bfdfdda.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns are not your only edge. <strong>Special perks</strong> earned during your adventure will power up your ball. Need <strong>more recoil</strong> when firing? <strong>Turrets</strong> to assist you in the ship's defense? Or maybe the ability to <strong>slow down time</strong> to make the perfect move? You have the cards in your hands to create the perfect <strong>build</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be aware, they are all <strong>randomized.</strong>\u00a0You are guaranteed to get a unique run each time you put a coin in the machine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1fee70fa56b5e913e9e041bded7961fc.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1fee70fa56b5e913e9e041bded7961fc.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1fee70fa56b5e913e9e041bded7961fc.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your flipper with precision, craft your own build, defeat your foes and master the scoreboard!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/fb78e1a24dc2c28e5a76dc11a001a6bc.poster.avif?t=1767862997\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/fb78e1a24dc2c28e5a76dc11a001a6bc.webm?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/fb78e1a24dc2c28e5a76dc11a001a6bc.mp4?t=1767862997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Le Rado"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/cd9349b3e85750b2d3ce9fdb8c965722d7a616a8/header.jpg?t=1767862997","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3498700/73